WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.720
With only one hour
left until Eneru's deadline,

3
00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:53.130
<b>Concerto</b>

4
00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.470
Almost there.

5
00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.270
I can't wait to see the
look on all their faces

6
00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:11.360
when they find out
I discovered the gold first.

7
00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.760
Look at those ruins.

8
00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.960
What's up with this place?

9
00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.000
The ground's all crooked.

10
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.880
Guess I'll go this way.

11
00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:40.310
Gold! Gold!

12
00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:45.940
No Holy. Stay.

13
00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:47.880
I said stay!

14
00:02:58.830 --> 00:02:59.920
What was I thinking?

15
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.040
I'm too little to do
this all by myself!

16
00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:04.590
I should've gone back!

17
00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.510
Interesting.

18
00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:12.140
You're the third one
to make it this far today.

19
00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.170
Who are you?

20
00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.380
I can't believe

21
00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:18.140
that spider-headed fool
was so careless.

22
00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.890
You killed Gedatsu, didn't you?

23
00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.770
I guess he
means that guy from earlier.

24
00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.600
I suppose it's for the best.

25
00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.180
The world is better off
with one less imbecile.

26
00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:31.520
Wouldn't you agree?

27
00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.950
What the...? I tripped over...

28
00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.490
Calm yourself.

29
00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:56.700
There's no need to be so afraid
of Holy, he's merely a pet.

30
00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:57.870
He won't bite you.

31
00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:59.040
But what about this guy?

32
00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:01.330
It looks like he's been
chewed up and spit out!

33
00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:03.500
Heh. I assure you.

34
00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.630
Holy is a very well-trained dog.

35
00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:07.880
He would never bite anyone.

36
00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.660
It was I who attacked that man.

37
00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:11.870
Huh?!

38
00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.120
Are you crazy?

39
00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:15.680
Why would you
do something like that?

40
00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.380
I am Sky Breeder Ohm.

41
00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:20.050
Now would you please be quiet!

42
00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:22.180
Do you think I'm not saddened

43
00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.850
by what's taken place here?

44
00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.930
Huh?

45
00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:27.690
I don't understand.

46
00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:29.860
Why do men choose to fight?

47
00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:32.770
when they must know
how fragile their lives are?

48
00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:34.530
I'm not really sure.

49
00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:37.280
Man was put here
to find happiness.

50
00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.570
Yet time after time, they
throw themselves into battle,

51
00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.280
only to lose their lives along

52
00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:45.560
with the joy they've
struggled so hard to find.

53
00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:50.440
What a strange and tragic
thing is man's nature!

54
00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.420
There's only
one way to be redeemed!

55
00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:56.160
And that is for all men to die!

56
00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.530
Ah!

57
00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:59.370
Oh, please, sir, you don't
really mean that, do you?

58
00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:01.540
This is bad!

59
00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:04.000
What have you come here for?

60
00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.460
Oh. I was just trying
to find the city of gold!

61
00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.420
Greed only leads to ruin!

62
00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.480
Huh?

63
00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:11.480
You must be rescued.

64
00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:14.760
You wanna rescue... me?

65
00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:20.680
Only losing your
life will save you

66
00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.270
from all your earthly desires!

67
00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:26.980
He doesn't want
to resuce me at all!

68
00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.450
But why?

69
00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:41.580
Yes!

70
00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:46.790
Go. Get out of here, Laki!

71
00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.420
Why? Tell me.

72
00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:55.460
Wyper,
he's headed for god's shrine.

73
00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:58.250
But Eneru isn't there!

74
00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:01.810
There's still time Laki.

75
00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:04.280
Stop Wyper.

76
00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.530
All right.

77
00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:07.910
I understand.
Now quiet, save your strength.

78
00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:14.580
Nobody can beat Eneru.

79
00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:18.070
I am living lightning.

80
00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:26.210
Laki.

81
00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:27.760
Hear me!

82
00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:31.590
He comes as lightning.

83
00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:34.340
An element that man has
feared from the beginning

84
00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:36.390
and rightly so.

85
00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:39.470
He can't be conquered.

86
00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.170
Don't worry, I'll stop Wyper.

87
00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:44.100
You just wait here
and save your energy.

88
00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:46.480
I'm going to leave
Aisa's bag with you.

89
00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:01.160
Nobody can beat Eneru.

90
00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.750
He can't be conquered.

91
00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:09.430
Kamakiri is so strong,
yet his will has been broken.

92
00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.840
If what he said is true,

93
00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:13.340
then Eneru's eaten
a Logia-type devil fruit.

94
00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:15.470
The most powerful kind of all!

95
00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:18.440
I've got to stop Wyper
before its too late!

96
00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:23.630
Hmm...

97
00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.980
I've been here.

98
00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:27.770
It looks familiar.

99
00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:30.080
Or have I?

100
00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:31.170
Maybe.

101
00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.380
Or maybe not.

102
00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:36.460
Huh. I'm not sure.

103
00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.050
Pfft.

104
00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.300
Are you laughing at me, huh?

105
00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.060
What are you so
worked up for anyway?

106
00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:48.850
The only reason you came
along in the first place

107
00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:50.000
is to get some food.

108
00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.460
My bad sense of
direction shouldn't matter!

109
00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:53.880
Ya dummy!

110
00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:00.620
No! No! No!

111
00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:03.440
Hey!

112
00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:05.320
Let go, you big
featherbrained jerk.

113
00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:07.120
There's no more food in there.

114
00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:09.120
Hey!

115
00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.870
Where are you taking us?

116
00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:15.730
Of all the
weird places to end up.

117
00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.650
Ooo. Huh?

118
00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.150
It's a dead end.

119
00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:23.490
Hmm...

120
00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.280
Huh?

121
00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:28.570
You can't be serious;
I walked all this way.

122
00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:31.200
Maybe...

123
00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:34.160
Maybe it's a trick door.

124
00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:36.130
Let's find out.

125
00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:39.710
I can always try busting
through the stupid thing.

126
00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.920
Gum-gum...

127
00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:43.920
...Bazooka!

128
00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:51.720
But it... it didn't even budge.

129
00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:01.920
Not again!

130
00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:20.880
He didn't follow me.

131
00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:22.930
I'm okay.

132
00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:27.280
I bet he's a Priest too,

133
00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.950
but it looks like there's a lot
of places to hide around here.

134
00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:32.080
If I can just stay hidden
long enough to escape,

135
00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:34.620
I can try to meet up
with the others.

136
00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.790
I have to make sure
he doesn't see me.

137
00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:39.960
He looked like a swordsman,

138
00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:43.050
so if I keep my distance
I should be okay.

139
00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.820
He's run quite a long way.

140
00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:50.570
But running from
salvation is futile.

141
00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:56.480
Attachment to this life
is a result of evil desires.

142
00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.890
Therefore...

143
00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:19.500
...the path to peace,
leads to but one place.

144
00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.120
This is the Ordeal of Iron!

145
00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.670
The survival rate is zero!

146
00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:28.610
I've gotta go find Laki!

147
00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:30.240
Oh, no, you don't!

148
00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:33.160
Wait! Aisa!

149
00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:38.790
Get back here!

150
00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:41.640
I've got to save Laki! Let go!

151
00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:43.310
I've gotta get out
of here right now!

152
00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:44.190
Let go!

153
00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:45.900
This isn't any of your business!

154
00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.610
Maybe it's not
any of my business,

155
00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:48.940
but there's no way
I'm gonna sit back

156
00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:50.860
and let a little kid
get herself killed!

157
00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:52.150
I'm a warrior!

158
00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:53.320
Yeah, yeah, I know.

159
00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:54.940
Kid warrior.

160
00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:58.200
Hey! Those dirty looks don't
scare me, so knock it off.

161
00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:01.370
Nami? Is everything okay?

162
00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.750
We're fine.

163
00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:05.000
All right, stop messing
around and get in the waver!

164
00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:07.840
You don't understand!

165
00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.760
You have to let me go,
so I can save my friends!

166
00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:11.280
I have to help them!

167
00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:13.660
You better knock it off right
now, or I'm gonna slug you!

168
00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:15.110
And no crying!

169
00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:19.410
Look, you don't want to end up
like Sanji and Usopp do you?

170
00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:21.330
Well do you?

171
00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.540
Come on, I'll help
you in the boat.

172
00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:38.700
Oh no!

173
00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:50.410
Okay. That was scary.

174
00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.230
What's with this
lame cave anyhow?

175
00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:58.330
First there was an earthquake,
then a flood of ocean clouds!

176
00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:00.090
I could've drowned!

177
00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.170
You hear me?

178
00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.170
Open up!

179
00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:09.220
Why's it going crazy?

180
00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:12.720
Let me out of here!

181
00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:14.310
Gum-gum...

182
00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:16.390
...Gatling!

183
00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.140
Nami, no!

184
00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.150
That way leads to the forest!

185
00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.290
Nami!

186
00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.130
What do we do?

187
00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:40.420
They've gone into the forest!

188
00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:47.140
Missed.

189
00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.600
Ha!

190
00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.230
You're lucky.

191
00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:04.070
Huh?

192
00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:05.560
Hmm? What's that?

193
00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:09.480
Who's that?

194
00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:10.620
I dunno.

195
00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.330
Something's coming!

196
00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:18.170
Go that way!

197
00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:21.130
That way!

198
00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:22.590
Lord of the Sky!

199
00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:23.590
No way!

200
00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:25.420
Aisa!

201
00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:49.070
We're inside the forest!

202
00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:52.990
Um.

203
00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:55.540
Hey! What's the idea?

204
00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.790
Are you even listening to me?

205
00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:59.590
Aww.

206
00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:03.510
I gonna pluck you,
and cook you up in a stew!

207
00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:09.760
Huh?

208
00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:11.220
Wha?

209
00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:17.150
Hey, come on!

210
00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:18.200
Fly higher!

211
00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:21.120
I don't wanna
be giant snake food!

212
00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:27.580
Can't you fly any
faster you dumb bird?

213
00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.920
It's still coming after us!

214
00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:33.620
Something must have
really pissed it off!

215
00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:52.140
Why you!

216
00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:09.940
To make it to god's shrine,

217
00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:13.590
I have to climb to
the top of Giant Jack.

218
00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:16.450
And if Eneru is there.

219
00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:19.730
It's time I brought an end
to our terrible history,

220
00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.650
once and for all!

221
00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.490
Now.

222
00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.500
Wyper.

223
00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:40.890
If you climb that
vine any further,

224
00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:44.220
you'll reach god's shrine.

225
00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:48.100
What makes you think you
have permission to pass?

226
00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:51.270
Damn you.

227
00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:53.080
It doesn't matter.

228
00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:56.710
Heading for that shrine
is no longer useful.

229
00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:58.920
Gan fall?

230
00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:03.510
What business do you have here?

231
00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:06.640
Still can't let go
of your old position?

232
00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:09.430
No, but I still
have responsibilities

233
00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:11.180
I've yet to fulfill.

234
00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.560
I thought you might be
interested in knowing

235
00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:17.060
I've recently come
from god's shrine.

236
00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:25.010
It's tragic, the entire thing's
been utterly destroyed.

237
00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:32.310
Naturally.

238
00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.980
Eneru was nowhere to be found.

239
00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:41.280
Perhaps it means he no
longer has any need for it.

240
00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:46.180
It appears that their
years of hard labor are over.

241
00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:49.880
You see, this island is
no longer useful to me.

242
00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:52.890
I've simply come
to bid you farewell.

243
00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.270
I demand to know, Ohm!

244
00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:01.560
What is it you and
your master seek to do?

245
00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:02.560
Hold on.

246
00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:05.210
You saying Eneru's not up there?

247
00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:24.770
One of Straw Hat's friends?

248
00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.530
Ow. That bird's gonna pay.

249
00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.860
It's you!

250
00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:34.450
Where am I?

251
00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.620
More ruins?

252
00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.290
Hmm.

253
00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:47.030
These guys all
look pretty tough.

254
00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:48.910
Oh well. Hey!

255
00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:50.690
Hand over the gold!

256
00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.570
Look what we have here.

257
00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:56.470
If it isn't another greedy
infidel, seeking his salvation.

258
00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:57.890
Enough!

259
00:17:57.980 --> 00:18:00.690
Get out of my way, or I'll
destroy every one of you!

260
00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:02.570
The time has come, Ohm.

261
00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:06.530
Tell me where Eneru
and the Divine Squad are!

262
00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.240
Ya stupid cave!

263
00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:12.400
Just let me out!

264
00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:24.830
I'm sure you each feel

265
00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.620
what you have
to say is important,

266
00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:29.330
but there's only one way
for your voice to be heard.

267
00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:32.710
You must survive
or find salvation!

268
00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:41.100
Hmph. Let's go, Holy.

269
00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:42.850
Be as ferocious
as you want, Boy.

270
00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:46.450
That one is our target, Pierre!

271
00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:48.030
Since he is the most powerful,

272
00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:50.330
we must neutralize
Eneru's priest first!

273
00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:52.410
Pi-e!

274
00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:58.050
I'm really gettin'
sick of you, snake.

275
00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:00.920
I mean, how the hell'd you
get way up here, anyway?

276
00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:08.600
Dammit!
One minute this place is up,

277
00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:10.890
the other, it's down!

278
00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.550
This is one messed-up cave!

279
00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:21.530
Well I guess the three of you...

280
00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.030
Hm?

281
00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:25.900
...will just
have to die together!

282
00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.240
Huh?

283
00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.120
Heh.

284
00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.920
You need to work
on your aim there, pal!

285
00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:43.090
Insolent Blue Sea Dweller!

286
00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:44.550
You think you can just
come to this land

287
00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:46.260
and take what's rightfully ours?

288
00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:48.840
You have no idea how long
and hard we've struggled!

289
00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:51.570
If you Sky People want
to blow each other to pieces,

290
00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.720
that's your business.

291
00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:58.650
It's like I told that priest,
I couldn't care less!

292
00:19:58.730 --> 00:20:00.400
That figures!

293
00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:07.320
I should have finished
you from the start!

294
00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:11.970
Damn.

295
00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:17.110
This guy's actually
tougher than I thought.

296
00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:31.450
Now die!

297
00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:50.720
All right, note to self.

298
00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:54.090
Gotta watch out for
those poisonous fangs.

299
00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:01.270
Speaking of fangs.

300
00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:09.030
Whoa. I've never seen
a dog move like that!

301
00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.290
Not many people have, friend.

302
00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.500
You'll find that Holy knows
a great number of commands

303
00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:16.660
beyond just "sit" and "stay."

304
00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:20.290
I'm a Skybreeder renowned for
my special animal training.

305
00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:23.080
I've trained him how to
walk upright on two legs

306
00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.710
and to box just like a
champion prizefighter.

307
00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:27.750
Show him, Holy!

308
00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:31.680
Nice doggie...

309
00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:33.890
Huh?

310
00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.320
Hm?

311
00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:40.780
Gan Fall.

312
00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:43.350
You were already
beaten by Shura!

313
00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:45.050
Don't you know when to quit?

314
00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:46.810
What do you really hope to do?

315
00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:48.690
I doubt you even have
enough strength left

316
00:21:48.770 --> 00:21:50.520
to wield that spear!

317
00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:52.810
I don't know
what Eneru is plotting,

318
00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:56.820
but I will stop him with my
dying breath if need be.

319
00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:00.650
There's no way a
washed-up god like you

320
00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:03.410
could ever understand
Eneru's noble thoughts.

321
00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:06.080
Gan Fall, you're
a foolish old man.

322
00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.960
A man that doesn't
have long to live.

323
00:22:15.900 --> 00:22:17.690
After them!

324
00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:19.780
Don't let the
Shandorians escape!

325
00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:24.730
What the...?

326
00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:28.070
Hey! You hear that?
It sounded like goats!

327
00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:31.360
The Divine Squad! If they
catch us, they'll kill us!

328
00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:33.410
The Divine Squad? Who are they?

329
00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:36.660
They're Eneru's soldiers!
Get us out of here, now!

330
00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:39.580
Uh, I'd love to, but in
case you haven't noticed,

331
00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:42.880
I have no idea
where we're going!

332
00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:58.690
That stupid snake!
It keeps getting in my way!

333
00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:12.410
Chopper! No!

334
00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:14.580
I'm coming! Hang on!

335
00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:19.840
I see. He was part of
your Blue Sea crew.

336
00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:24.050
Hey. Watch your step over there.

337
00:23:32.130 --> 00:23:33.710
What the...?

338
00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:36.270
Barbed wire?

339
00:23:37.900 --> 00:23:40.110
So that's his ordeal?

340
00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:43.430
Chopper! Talk to me!

341
00:23:43.510 --> 00:23:45.770
Say something! Why?

342
00:23:45.850 --> 00:23:49.480
Why did you try and take
this guy on? Come on!

343
00:23:49.560 --> 00:23:51.770
A shame, isn't it?

344
00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:56.790
Those barbs? Iron Cloud.

345
00:23:57.280 --> 00:23:59.820
They're light as a cloud,
but hard as iron.

346
00:23:59.900 --> 00:24:02.450
Blown into shape
by a milky dial.

347
00:24:02.550 --> 00:24:04.640
I've rigged several of 'em
with hidden triggers.

348
00:24:04.740 --> 00:24:06.740
You and your little friend
found out the hard way

349
00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:09.460
what happens when
you step on one.

350
00:24:09.540 --> 00:24:12.420
This field is a weapon.
I don't have to attack you.

351
00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:16.840
I can sit back and watch your
own blundering do you in.

352
00:24:16.920 --> 00:24:19.760
I'm partially responsible
for that animal's defeat,

353
00:24:19.840 --> 00:24:21.420
but he's also to blame.

354
00:24:21.530 --> 00:24:25.320
He stumbled into my
ordeal all by himself.

355
00:24:30.370 --> 00:24:32.740
I guess you'll want
to get revenge now, eh?

356
00:24:33.400 --> 00:24:35.780
No.

357
00:24:35.860 --> 00:24:37.280
Believe it or not,

358
00:24:37.370 --> 00:24:40.460
I normally don't like fighting
for that reason at all.

359
00:24:40.540 --> 00:24:43.750
Oh. Heh. I'm actually impressed.

360
00:24:43.840 --> 00:24:45.670
Normally.

361
00:24:47.840 --> 00:24:51.180
But you've changed my mind.

362
00:25:03.560 --> 00:25:05.810
Well, Conis,
I think we've arrived.

363
00:25:05.890 --> 00:25:08.230
This is the seashore
where our Blue Sea friends

364
00:25:08.310 --> 00:25:09.850
are planning to meet, right?

365
00:25:09.940 --> 00:25:11.270
Yes, Father.

366
00:25:11.350 --> 00:25:13.020
This is where Nami told me
they'd be dropping anchor.

367
00:25:13.370 --> 00:25:15.490
Well then,
what should we do now?

368
00:25:15.490 --> 00:25:18.330
I really wasn't expecting
to look after their ship.

369
00:25:18.660 --> 00:25:22.700
Nonetheless, we must protect it
at all costs until they return!

370
00:25:22.790 --> 00:25:25.200
I'll sound the horn to
scare off any threats!

371
00:25:25.290 --> 00:25:27.460
Right. Good idea, Father!

372
00:25:27.470 --> 00:25:29.510
Let them hear our resolve!

373
00:25:34.380 --> 00:25:36.210
Ah, perfect.

374
00:25:40.760 --> 00:25:42.220
Keep your eyes open, Suu.

375
00:25:42.300 --> 00:25:43.760
I'm counting on you
to keep watch.

376
00:25:50.090 --> 00:25:53.100
Hang on! I'll nurse both
of you back to health!

377
00:25:53.180 --> 00:25:55.430
You'll be better in no time!

378
00:26:02.480 --> 00:26:05.030
Please everyone, be safe.

379
00:26:05.110 --> 00:26:08.240
I'm sorry the sky
island is like this.

380
00:26:17.470 --> 00:26:21.010
Don't stop
until we've taken Eneru's head!

381
00:26:21.070 --> 00:26:22.370
The only heads that will roll

382
00:26:22.450 --> 00:26:24.700
are yours, Shandorian!

383
00:26:24.840 --> 00:26:27.630
Climb up Giant Jack!

384
00:26:27.700 --> 00:26:30.460
Don't let
them get to God's Shrine!

385
00:26:34.990 --> 00:26:38.540
Wyper! Please don't
use the Reject anymore!

386
00:26:39.510 --> 00:26:43.640
Now, Divine Squad!
Let's kill them all!

387
00:26:53.130 --> 00:26:55.340
Don't challenge Eneru, Wyper!

388
00:27:01.790 --> 00:27:05.920
He can't be defeated.
No matter what we do.

389
00:27:27.100 --> 00:27:30.440
That's right. Those of you
still in the game,

390
00:27:30.530 --> 00:27:35.790
climb your way to the Upper
Ruins and destroy each other.

391
00:27:38.790 --> 00:27:41.960
There will only
be five survivors.

392
00:27:44.140 --> 00:27:48.900
My words and
prophecies are absolute.

393
00:27:53.970 --> 00:27:55.100
Hm?

394
00:27:59.360 --> 00:28:01.610
Stop this insanity now, Wyper!

395
00:28:01.700 --> 00:28:02.450
I'm not here to...

396
00:28:02.530 --> 00:28:03.990
You're not what, Old Man?

397
00:28:04.040 --> 00:28:06.250
You believe that
you're not my enemy?

398
00:28:07.240 --> 00:28:09.040
To the Shandorians,
there's no difference

399
00:28:09.120 --> 00:28:11.830
between you and Eneru!
Both of you must go!

400
00:28:11.920 --> 00:28:14.170
Quit being stubborn!
Listen to reason!

401
00:28:17.500 --> 00:28:18.630
Huh?

402
00:28:21.880 --> 00:28:23.430
Damn you!

403
00:28:34.300 --> 00:28:36.800
My Burn Bazooka didn't
even faze that thing.

404
00:28:36.890 --> 00:28:39.100
What're those scales made of?

405
00:28:43.600 --> 00:28:49.730
No! No more! I'm sick
of this stupid cave!

406
00:29:08.350 --> 00:29:10.650
What... was that?

407
00:29:10.730 --> 00:29:15.570
Hmph. Typical Blue Sea Dweller.
You didn't expect it.

408
00:29:15.650 --> 00:29:19.610
You see This sword of mine
is also made of Iron Cloud.

409
00:29:19.700 --> 00:29:21.580
In other words,

410
00:29:21.660 --> 00:29:24.240
the blade itself is actually
Iron Cloud expelled

411
00:29:24.330 --> 00:29:27.460
from a dial that's conveniently
embedded in the sword's hilt,

412
00:29:27.540 --> 00:29:31.000
and it will hunt its prey
to the ends of the earth!

413
00:29:34.130 --> 00:29:36.300
Well, do you
understand it better now,

414
00:29:36.380 --> 00:29:38.220
Swordsman from the Blue Sea?

415
00:29:38.300 --> 00:29:40.140
Yeah, it's just like a whip.

416
00:29:40.220 --> 00:29:42.640
I get it. You White
White Sea people

417
00:29:42.720 --> 00:29:46.310
are more circus performers
than warriors!

418
00:29:46.390 --> 00:29:47.680
Hm?

419
00:29:51.230 --> 00:29:52.230
Holy.

420
00:29:53.190 --> 00:29:55.980
We're going to have
to fight separately.

421
00:29:58.820 --> 00:30:00.820
From the sound of things,

422
00:30:00.900 --> 00:30:03.950
the Upper Ruins are
about to get very busy.

423
00:30:17.500 --> 00:30:21.090
The Sky Knight!
I didn't expect him to be here.

424
00:30:21.170 --> 00:30:23.760
We're here to
assist you, oh mighty Ohm!

425
00:30:27.880 --> 00:30:30.390
Look who's here.

426
00:30:30.470 --> 00:30:32.100
Well, you know what this means.

427
00:30:32.100 --> 00:30:34.850
Yeah. It means we're
the only ones left.

428
00:30:34.880 --> 00:30:36.130
Don't worry, Wyper.

429
00:30:36.210 --> 00:30:39.180
We'll help you get to Eneru
and take his head off!

430
00:30:45.240 --> 00:30:46.400
Hey, wait.

431
00:30:46.490 --> 00:30:49.410
That should work.
I'll just dig my way out.

432
00:30:56.280 --> 00:30:58.190
That giant snake!

433
00:31:02.720 --> 00:31:04.890
– It's laughing?
– It's laughing?

434
00:31:10.230 --> 00:31:12.140
Hold it!

435
00:31:13.600 --> 00:31:17.110
Would you goats
just leave us alone!

436
00:31:17.190 --> 00:31:18.070
Nami...

437
00:31:18.150 --> 00:31:19.030
Aisa!

438
00:31:19.110 --> 00:31:20.530
No!

439
00:31:20.610 --> 00:31:22.240
Kill them both!

440
00:31:38.920 --> 00:31:41.170
Aisa! What are you doing here?

441
00:31:41.560 --> 00:31:44.400
What the...? Nami, what
are you doing here?

442
00:31:44.480 --> 00:31:47.020
Hey, Zoro. What's happening?

443
00:31:47.110 --> 00:31:48.440
Wyper!

444
00:31:48.530 --> 00:31:51.950
What is it you're plotting
here, Blue Sea Dweller?

445
00:31:52.030 --> 00:31:53.820
Aisa! Get away from that woman!

446
00:32:00.900 --> 00:32:02.280
That was close...

447
00:32:02.280 --> 00:32:05.490
Wyper! You're a monster!

448
00:32:05.860 --> 00:32:08.490
Why did you two come
to such a perilous place?

449
00:32:09.120 --> 00:32:10.740
We didn't mean to!

450
00:32:10.830 --> 00:32:13.450
We were...
chased by this giant...

451
00:32:14.370 --> 00:32:15.210
...snake.

452
00:32:21.730 --> 00:32:23.770
You idiot!

453
00:32:23.840 --> 00:32:24.960
Aisa...

454
00:32:38.580 --> 00:32:41.500
Wyper!

455
00:32:44.290 --> 00:32:45.710
You were so distracted

456
00:32:45.790 --> 00:32:49.090
that you neglected to
protect yourselves.

457
00:32:49.170 --> 00:32:52.300
Quit worryin' about
other people!

458
00:32:52.380 --> 00:32:56.800
Accept it! There's nothing
you can do to save them!
